<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HomeSide starts as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HomeSide starts as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said on Tuesday analyst George Bicher had started coverage of HomeSide Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Jacksonville, Fla., mortgage banking company closed on Monday at 16-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
